This case is excluded from the default Alltest run because it takes
several minutes (snappyHexMesh + RANS solve + radiationDose
post-process) - too long for CI on every pull request.

To run it locally, either invoke its Allrun directly:

    ./Allrun
    ./Allrun-postProcess
    ./validate

or set RUN_LONG_TESTS=1 when calling the Alltest harness:

    cd tutorials
    RUN_LONG_TESTS=1 ./Alltest

The marker file's presence (any name, any content) is what tells
Alltest to skip the case. Remove it to opt the case back in.
